# Third-party census data must never be committed here: this repo is MIT, and
# real forest censuses are not ours to relicense. Everything the docs and
# tests need is generated instead; see dev/simulate_demo_data.py.
examples/*census_cortag_gxy.csv

# The demo-data generator: only its output (examples/demo_census.csv and
# src/vulntool/demo_census.csv) is part of the package. Kept locally, not in
# git, so it does not distract from the tool itself.
/dev/
